      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Grok 4.7 works extremely well with our Build harness\n\nhttps://X.ai/Build",
      "quote": {
        "author": "aksheyd",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013833485073686529/PL66L1Q5_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-22 00:20:01",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-09-21T16:20:01.000Z",
        "id": "2102070351786283181",
        "images": [],
        "name": "akshey",
        "text": "Excited to bring 4.7 to you all! \n\nNumerics aside, it's incredibly capable in Grok Build/Cursor. We spent a lot of hours on the harness, iterating with some of the greatest engineers in the world. \n\nAlso, the fast mode has INSANE tps. Happy Grok Building :) Lmk what you think!",
        "url": "https://x.com/aksheyd/status/2102070351786283181",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
